Julian(V.O.):I can hear you.

Ethan：用箭也得先拉得开弓。

Ethan: Archers still need to draw the bow first.

▲Leo 使劲拉，脸憋红了，弓弦纹丝不动。

Leo：我以后拉得开！

Leo: I'll be able to later!

▲三个人在林子里烤了一只兔子，Leo吃得满脸油。

Leo：好吃！爹地烤的比这好对不对？

Leo: Tasty! Papa roasts better, right?

Ethan（小声对Leo)：你爹地烤什么都糊。

Ethan: Your papa burns everything.

Julian：我听得见。

Julian: I can hear you.

